sequenceDiagram
  participant AD as Administrator
  participant K as Keywarden
  participant AG as Agent
  participant H as Managed Host
  participant U as User

  AD->>K: Revoke access at t0
  Note right of K: Policy state changes immediately

  loop Poll interval = N seconds
    AG->>K: Poll /accounts + /ssh-ca
  end

  K-->>AG: Revoked state at t0 + delta
  AG->>H: Remove/lock account and apply new state
  H-->>U: SSH denied

  Note over AD,U: Effective revocation latency <= poll interval + agent apply time
